      en: ["POSCO was founded in 1968 and its first blast furnace in Pohang began operations in 1973.", "The Pohang Steel Works has an annual production capacity of approximately 16.2 million tons of steel.", "The facility was the first in the world to commercialize the FINEX iron-making technology.", "The plant site covers 2,200 acres (approx. 9 square kilometers) of reclaimed land in Pohang.", "POSCO has been ranked as the world's most competitive steelmaker for 13 consecutive years.", "The complex includes five blast furnaces, including some of the largest in the global steel industry."],
